            <div xml:id="d81">

                <pb facs="0209" n="95" xml:id="pg95"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.6463/79: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-12-26T12:00:00-04:40"><hi rendition="#italic">December 26,
                                1922—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received December 27—5
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>49. Minister of the Interior informs me that the municipality Santiago has given
                    option of 120 days concession of Santo Domingo Light and Power Company to Santo
                    Domingo Brewing Company represented by Kalb, Austrian, and Contreras,
                    Mexican.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
